    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4a433aa0d73bc04f277d43b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她起跑的动作相当洗练，赛程中表现出的耐力也不错。\r\n而她对冲刺时机的掌握更是如教科书那般优秀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecc08de53e90079f787bcfc0149f1c5353939552acceb01e1980fcc4594034a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
