      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽说与胜利失之交臂，\r\n但若是能多加锻炼的话，一定能够成长为相当出色的选手吧。不过——",
      "source_fingerprint": "25b5f353463f91930870a4910803fafe890260b4b629e5ad4c996c8deca92c18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
