    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee20d3ad3b8c3b881e31051a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "人气第一的，是光辉无限的三冠赛马娘。\r\n我姐姐与强击都是她的粉丝，所以在电视机前拼了命地为她加油。\r\n但最终，获胜的是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "07796109a606bc17a574dbaa6fec6e2c0c3cc6d353a1e6398bba8c3fd637adca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
