      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在一片喝彩声之中，向着天空怒号的她……非常美丽。\r\n而我——不知何时，已经紧贴在了电视机前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44a0a5fc41ed4c3242c20acc4c6d296cbcf367cbc7a96cd0353a74b7ec2d8be2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
