      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "火热的激情涌上心头，心底也被这热情触动……\r\n我不由自主地冲出家门，不顾一切地狂奔起来。\r\n然后——",
      "source_fingerprint": "a108c40d7b5c64136753d9107aa0b33cc6d405521d8b97ff5f1a23c6776eb73b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
